## Model card

- **Name:** Space Bunny Alpha (anonymous stealth preview)
- **Short description:** Anonymous large model listed on OpenRouter on 2026-09-23 as a stealth preview. Advertised for fast inference, coding and multimodal input with adjustable reasoning; builder undisclosed.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` (`POST https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions`), routed via third-party stealth provider; also mirrored as `siora-space-bunny-alpha`. Chat Completions API with `reasoning`, `reasoning_effort`, `tools`, `tool_choice` support.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-23 first listing (stealth preview); knowledge cutoff unknown
- **IDs:** `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` (no vendor ID, no weights, no licence published; no Free ID on OpenCode Zen)
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total, 524,288 max completion tokens — per OpenRouter endpoint record as of 2026-09-23 (unverified by independent measurement; tokenizer undisclosed)
- **Modalities:** text, image, video in; text out; mandatory reasoning (`low`–`max`, default `medium`); tool calling yes; JSON mode (`response_format`) yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** $0 / 1M in and $0 / 1M out during stealth preview (free); post-preview pricing undisclosed; preview prompts/completions may be logged by the anonymous lab — not for private source
- **Architecture:** proprietary, undisclosed (no params, no licence, no vendor page; no tokenizer forensics published as of 2026-09-23, unlike prior `ox-alpha` → GLM-5.3 Flash fingerprint)

