### Negative-findings notes (why excluded, what would un-exclude)

- Searched 2026-09-24: OpenRouter listing/docs, OrcaRouter leak analysis, Siora deep-dive, TPS report, LM Market Cap, PicksByModel — unanimous: anonymous listing, zero published benchmarks.
- Operator adjectives ("blazing-fast", "strong coding") have no published throughput/latency or benchmark backing; endpoint record publishes no tokens/sec or TTFT (third-party telemetry P50 0.93s / 79 tok/s best-case cited by TPS is routing telemetry, not a quality benchmark).
- Un-exclude trigger: vendor reveal with model card plus ≥1 verified public benchmark number (e.g. full SWE-bench Verified, LiveCodeBench, GPQA Diamond, or AA Index run) attributable to `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` or its revealed successor ID.

